    <p><a href="../articles/06_12_02.html">Bolex Christmas Gift Ideas -- Interactive Guide</a><br>
      A reprint and images from a 1959 christmas issue of the Bolex Reporter magazine.  Nearly 50 years later, and they're still good gift suggestions!</p>
