<p>Speaking of shopping: Christmas is always a great time to buy <a href="http://rover.ebay.com/rover/1/711-53200-19255-0/1?type=1&amp;campid=5335822045&amp;toolid=10001&amp;customid=text">Bolex Equipment on eBay</a>, as it seems many people auction their old cameras and projectors, possibly for extra holiday cash.  The number of items available, from what I've seen as an eBayer of 10+ years, is always highest around this time of year before dropping off significantly in January and February.  So if you're looking for extra lenses, accessories or a new Reflex, it's the perfect time to find them.
	  </p>
	  
